{"apiVersion":"cyberboar.dev/v1","kind":"PolicyBundle","name":"baseline","policySha256":"71d321257452dd63e22ad8d26d628c0469540d3f9d32d062981deccdb61aadbf","policy":"# Baseline example: deny-listed posture\n# Anything not matched is allowed\napiVersion: cyberboar.dev/v1\nkind: Policy\nmetadata:\n  name: baseline\n  description: Keep secrets and destructive infrastructure commands away from coding agents.\nspec:\n  defaults:\n    posture: deny-listed\n  files:\n    deny:\n      - \"**/.env*\"\n      - \"**/*.pem\"\n      - \"~/.ssh/**\"\n      - \"~/.aws/credentials\"\n    ask:\n      - \"**/terraform.tfstate\"\n    # A directory that contains a protected file is treated like that file\n    # (grep -r KEY ., tar ~). deny is the default; ask or ignore loosen it.\n    containing: deny\n  commands:\n    deny:\n      - \"terraform apply\"\n      - \"kubectl delete\"\n      - \"curl | sh\"\n    ask:\n      - \"git push\"\n    denyInterpreters: true\n  mcp:\n    allow:\n      - \"github\"\n      - \"internal-docs/search\"\n  audit:\n    sink: \"https://cyberboar.internal/api/v1/events\"\n","signature":"cyberboar.dev/policy-signature/v2\nserial 1790856000\nexpires 2026-12-30T12:00:00Z\nsignature DMsHvBEPmeRWuC9XBiCEQhjBOmROlIbRMF2GFt/Vmmk0JqGwLWqpfHkNZ7MlDofMvZT9jw0UUXVnH2ckDaMiAQ==\n"}
